      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One way I could see this implemented is that the falloff distance can dynamically change depending of your mic/voice volume. The more quiet you talk, shorter will be the falloff of your voice audio source. So naturally, whispering would only allow near people to actually hear you. This could be enabled by the user who wants to whisper and a UI would appears to visualize your realtime voice distance",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
