      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this could be achieved (in VR at least) by putting a hand up to your mouth. This way it could be quickly/easily toggled on and off without having to put any thought into it as it would mimic what people do when they whisper IRL. On the flip side, we could also implement a yelling system that increases voice fall-off by putting both hands up to your mouth like you would when shouting IRL",
